      en: ["Area: 250 hectares along the banks of the Devoll River.", "Status: Protected as a Category IV Managed Nature Reserve since 1996.", "Location: Korçë region, near the main road to Bilisht.", "Flora: Riparian gallery forests including Salix and Populus species.", "Ornithology: Key stopover point for migratory bird species.", "Geology: Alluvial sediment soils typical of river valleys."],
